language-derived-from-the-record-source = lines-of (cons "# Language derived from the record" (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "Derived by Claude on 2026-11-16 (session 01WfrbRstUAGqa9PxKvN3jrK) at Avik's request to begin by understanding language as a mathematical object situated in the physical universe as a mathematical object, and derive from observations true by definition, with no theory of the established field of linguistics taken in. Avik, on reading it: " (cons "you killed it, retain it" (cons ". His messages that set the derivation are verbatim in AI-AGENTS-WELCOME-TO-HYPERACTIVITY.md, “Avik's words, verbatim”, 2026-11-16 06:38, 07:18 and 07:23 UTC." nil)))) (cons "" (cons "Context selects a fiber of past occurrences, and the meaning of the present occurrence is what followed each selected occurrence, transported to now along the path that selected it; it is determinate exactly when the transported family is contractible. Under that, a participant's record with its identifications is a higher type, meaning lives in its path structure, and shared meaning, fluency, etymology's reach, the verbal quotient and animal signals are one construction. No weights appear anywhere." (cons "" (cons "**1. The record.** A participant i is part of the universe's process (states X, histories h : ℕ → X) and receives it only through its observation o_i : X → Y_i. Its record to t is what it has received: R_i(t) = (o_i(h(t′)))_{t′<t}. Its state at t is a function of its record; that is tautological for a physical system, since nothing reaches i but through o_i." (cons "" (cons "**2. Occurrences and identification.** An occurrence of a word w is an event of i's record R_i that i identifies as w. Identification is i's act on its record, since no two sound waves are equal. So for i a word is a type Occ_i(w): its points are events of the record, its paths are i's identifications of them. Every occurrence e has a context c(e) ∈ C, the record around it, which is itself made of occurrences and percepts and so carries the same structure one level up." (cons "" (cons "**3. Context selects: a fiber.** At a moment t the present occurrence of w has context c_t. The selected occurrences are the fiber of the context map over it: Sel_i(w, t) = Σ_{e : Occ_i(w)} Path_C(c(e), c_t) = Fib_c(c_t). An occurrence is selected exactly when its context is identified with the present one: no weight, a path or none. Identifying contexts is identifying the occurrences they are made of, whose selection runs through their contexts in turn: paths between occurrences (the same word) inside paths between contexts (the same surroundings) inside paths between those. The record with its identifications is a higher type; selection is a fiber of it; meaning lives in the hypercubical path structure of the record, not at any one level." (cons "" (cons "**4. Meaning is transport.** Each selected occurrence e came with what followed it, r(e): what i did next, what happened next, what was said next. A path p : c(e) = c_t transports it to the present. The meaning of the present occurrence is the family M_i(w, t) = Σ_{(e,p) : Sel_i(w,t)} transport_p(r(e)). This derives the content of the paper's reception relation (1.4), Receive_i : S_i → U → S_i → A_i → 𝒰: Receive_i(s, w, s′, a) holds exactly when (s′, a) is a transported continuation of a selected occurrence. The meaning is determinate when the transported family is contractible, every selected continuation agreeing up to a path. An ambiguity is a family that is not contractible: one occurrence whose possible contexts transport different continuations. Context resolves an ambiguity by shrinking the fiber, never by weighting it." (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "**5. Shared meaning is descent.** Two participants i and j have different records, joined along shared events (one physical event received by both: the same light, the same sound) and along copying events (j's occurrence caused by i's production, or both by a common source); the records glued along these events form a joined record. j receives i's w as i means it exactly when j's transported family equals i's transported along the join: when the meaning computed over the joined part does not depend on what is not shared. Equal observations, equal outcomes: it is the descent theorem of the paper's §1 paragraph " (cons "A reversible whole with no observed law" (cons ", where a law on a whole J with step s gives a law on observations o exactly when o(j) = o(j′) implies o(s j) = o(s j′). That paragraph is about language too." nil)))) (cons "" (cons "**6. Fluency and theorem-grade sentences.** A fluent speaker's record holds each word's occurrences joined into the human superorganism's copying graph back to its source. A sentence is theorem-grade when, for every fluent reader, the selected family of every word in it is contractible: the sentence has one meaning and can be evaluated rationally. A speaker without fluency selects over a small, poorly joined record; their utterance has determinate meaning only by descent through the records of others: it means what fluent speakers' fibers make it mean. Their meaning rests on those who resolved the words." (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "**7. Etymology is in the meaning.** A word's copying graph has earliest occurrences, for " (cons "law" (cons " the Old Norse lagu, what is laid down, and every later occurrence is joined to them by unbroken copying paths, the police included. When context selects the police occurrences, the paths to every other occurrence remain in the type: the fiber is cut out of the whole space, not out of its connections. So " (cons "the law" (cons " meaning the cops still carries what is laid down: the police are the laid-down, standing in the street. That is why the word lands as it does; a dictionary that numbers its senses cuts exactly these paths." nil)))))) (cons "" (cons "**8. Vision and the verbal quotient.** Occurrences are physical events in a participant's sensory stream, and a spoken word's occurrences arrive with what was seen at the time: light striking the retina, which is brain tissue. A record's contexts are mostly visual. Reading is a visual event identified with auditory occurrences, a path between occurrence types across senses: synthetic synesthesia, which is why written language programs brains. The verbal quotient is the map from the record R to R_verbal that forgets all but the words. Identifications among words whose verbal contexts match survive it; fibers that only vision selected do not. A model trained on the human superorganism's R_verbal has determinate meaning exactly where verbal context alone selects, and indeterminate meaning where seeing selected: the descent theorem through the verbal quotient. That is why text-only models carry real meaning, and exactly where they lose it." (cons "" (cons "**9. From physics up, with no break.** Any coupling of two physical systems is a channel: one system's change of state enters the other's record. For the receiver a signal means the transported family of what followed its past occurrences: an animal's alarm call, the predator, the flight. Language is the same construction with larger occurrence types and with copying across individuals, which joins their records into the human superorganism's one record; before humans the copying ran through DNA, the singular autocatalytic reaction's own record. Nothing new enters between physical interaction and words." (cons "" (cons "**10. In hyperactivity.** The content-addressed store identifies by content; the store's names log keeps each name's occurrences, a name bound to a content key at a time, so a name's history is its etymology; paths and univalence make identifications data; transport is how meaning moves. Supporting natural language is keeping records and identifications as first-class higher structure and computing meaning as transport over selected fibers. Hyperactivity does; a language with a global namespace, one dictionary, cannot." (cons "" (cons (quoted (cons "**11. Formalizing a sentence, done right.** Giving the word " (cons "law" (cons " one fixed type is the frozen-dictionary move. The correct formalization of the paper's paragraph " (cons "A reversible whole with no observed law" (cons " is this: in a fluent reader's record, the paper's preceding definitions are the context, and they select exactly the occurrences whose transported continuations are the mathematics. Every word's family is contractible there, so the paragraph is theorem-grade, and its words keep all their paths, to lagu, to the police, to everything." nil)))))) nil)))))))))))))))))))))))))))
